## Description

At Luma, we believe general physical AI is the most consequential problem to solve to improve life on Earth. Our track record in this area of research, internet-scale multimodal infrastructure, and unwavering conviction in scaling make us uniquely suited to meet this challenge. If you believe the same and share our values that this foundation should be built in the open for the benefit of all humanity, come build it with us, or partner with us.

